al":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+ka"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85299a62-9d1c-4344-a7c5-954d7c73e8a1","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"これ国内販売オンキヨーなのか……\n\u003chttps://www.4gamer.net/games/999/G999902/20210406040/\u003e","ts":"1619508008.124000","attachments":[{"fallback":"iPhoneを挟み込むゲームパッド「Backbone One」をオンキヨーが国内販売","id":1,"title":"iPhoneを挟み込むゲームパッド「Backbone One」をオンキヨーが国内販売","title_link":"https://www.4gamer.net/games/999/G999902/20210406040/","text":"　2021年4月20日，オンキヨーホームエンターテイメントは，米Backbone labs製のiPhone用ゲームパッド「Backbone One」を国内販売すると発表した。iPhoneを挟み込んで使うワイヤード接続型ゲームパッドで，Xbox風のレイアウトを採用する。すでに予約の受付を開始しており，税込価格は1万2980円となる。","image_url":"https://www.4gamer.net/games/999/G999902/20210406040/SS/005.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"4gamer.net","service_icon":"https://www.4gamer.net/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.4gamer.net/games/999/G999902/20210406040/","original_url":"https://www.4gamer.net/games/999/G999902/20210406040/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7aFD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2fe04c8-19a4-4a1f-aaa9-c84023247a9b","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"任天堂のコントローラー批判するのは結構だが、それならなぜサードパーティーが純正を越えるものを作らないのかと前からいってる","ts":"1619507919.123000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nq5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6a8bf8e-fdf2-4f54-838a-f6c69581ddfe","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"よくある中華コントローラーにしか見えない","ts":"1619507892.122900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5+A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6cdbe05f-0e89-4678-b679-de2d2c0bc810","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"\u0026gt; 好きじゃないところ\n\u0026gt; プラスチック製でボタンもちゃらくて、iPhoneの高級感と釣り合わない。ゲームライブラリの管理や対応タイトル探しの機能がない。\nこれ褒めてるように見えて実はボロクソに貶している系の記事では","ts":"1619507877.122700","edited":{"user":"U01D44KSY9Z","ts":"1619507891.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GU2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fdbd4034-1e36-4862-9649-3a92df8bb3a5","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"さて、どうやって任天堂に勝つの？","ts":"1619507811.121900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NlWv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a728bb4-4793-4f22-81dd-5b0746259cf3","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"確かに世の中にはちゃんと動かないコントローラーは多いからね","ts":"1619507799.121800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lWMnV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8edacb99-b138-4bd3-94c9-5c04fcc4111a","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ちゃんと動いてえらい！\nこの記者メンタルケアに向いているのでは","ts":"1619507772.121700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kjY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26f1069d-7e09-4415-8d52-cd5e4030bd83","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"なのが最高にひどいんだけど、どこからつっこめばよいの？","ts":"1619507758.121500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XWxzH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"769df7bf-a82b-42d8-9bea-91c6edc95c41","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"良いところ\nちゃんと動いた！","ts":"1619507743.121200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8/A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9eb63653-9df3-4347-a928-a8aed9676bc3","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"スマホゲームやってる層は外部デバイスを必要としない気がします\nそしてSwitchで遊ぶ層は尚更このコントローラを必要としないはずなのでそもそも戦いが起きないのでは","ts":"1619507599.121000","edited":{"user":"U01D44KSY9Z","ts":"1619507666.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"13DR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3652932-4a7d-4a99-91fa-99b206f962b9","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ジョイコンより高くジョイコンよりショボいコントローラーでよく戦えると思ったなこの記者は","ts":"1619507552.120100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+oBZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b999ed5-fdaf-4f84-a1ce-9960f06db953","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そして、スイッチのジョイコンでさえあれだけたたかれるのに","ts":"1619507532.119600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R+2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"220acfe6-4fac-489b-bd46-35bb03fc9046","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"スマホゲームでコントローラーつけてプレーする人がどれだけいるのか","ts":"1619507514.119300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7u47i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00a3a759-870e-4dba-b5b4-2ddf71a522d6","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"いいかねないと思われたんだろう","ts":"1619507440.119200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x07gI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c6212fa-cfcd-491a-a7f4-45fa5dea84d7","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"？？？「任天堂の倒し方、知ってますよ」\n本当に言ったかどうかすら分からない言葉で長年弄られてる","ts":"1619507423.119100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sS/q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af3ed859-291b-4da0-9f45-ddbeb5e5b4b8","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"スマホゲームはコンシューマーゲームを潰すとか、クラウドゲーミングとかVRとか","ts":"1619507418.118900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q9uI9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ec9bc70-9c49-4095-bc7d-b0707fe1bb2b","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そんなことをいって散っていった企業やサービスを沢山知ってるよ","ts":"1619507391.118400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o6zpl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05fbab43-a029-4f9c-b753-f576dc626c78","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"煽りたいだけかな？","ts":"1619507377.118300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original"